{"id":"n32138-1-8","stage":2,"title":"결제 · 结算","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n32138-1-8-1","ko":"결제는 내가 할게.","zh":"付款我来付吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"결제는","meaning":"结算，结账，买单","explanation":"결제：结算，结账，买单；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"결제","audio":"/audio/8d4f3299dd01d1b16e67.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32138","senseId":"1","lemma":"결제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"할게.","meaning":"表示实现前面动作的想法。","explanation":"하다：表示实现前面动作的想法。；ㄹ게：向对方表达说话人的决定或承诺，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8d4f3299dd01d1b1","term":"결제","zh":"结算，结账，买单","audio":"/audio/8d4f3299dd01d1b16e67.mp3","entryId":"32138","definition":"支付货款或该支付的钱，结束交易。","pronunciation":["결쩨"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示实现前面动作的想法。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"表示实现前面动作的想法。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7bb53bc73c0cbadab8f4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n32138-1-8-2","ko":"고마워. 사실은 지금 돈이 부족하거든.","zh":"谢谢。其实我现在手头有点紧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"고마워.","meaning":"感谢，感激","explanation":"고맙다：感谢，感激；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"고맙다","audio":"/audio/ded2b4943e89f57dd33d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20041","senseId":"1","lemma":"고맙다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사실은","meaning":"事实上，其实","explanation":"사실：事实上，其实；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"사실","audio":"/au